	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"公式外伝「機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ月鋼」登場のガンダム・フレーム機体「ガンダム・アスタロトオリジン」がキット化！",
			"• 特徴的な形状の武装にはギミックも搭載され、腰部ラックへ懸架する際の連結状態も再現可能！■肩部と背部のパーツは変形し、滑空形態をとることもできる！"
		],
		"en": [
			"The Gundam frame aircraft \"Gundam Astaroth Origin\" from the official Gaiden \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Steel\" has been made into a kit!",
			"• The uniquely shaped armament is also equipped with a gimmick, and the connected state when suspended from the waist rack can be reproduced! ■The shoulder and back parts can be deformed, allowing it to take on a gliding form!"
		]
